(?AnimaTruc Developer Manual \(Forge 1.20.1 / Java 17\)) Tj
T*
(Version: 1.0.0-proprietary.7) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Purpose) Tj
T*
(AnimaTruc provides a proprietary animation runtime for Minecraft Forge mods with:) Tj
T*
(- deterministic blending) Tj
T*
(- animation graph layers) Tj
T*
(- procedural modifiers) Tj
T*
(- block-ground contact IK) Tj
T*
(- automatic locomotion presets) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Automatic Locomotion Presets) Tj
T*
(Supported automatic profiles:) Tj
T*
(- BIPED   = 2 legs) Tj
T*
(- HEXAPOD = 6 legs) Tj
T*
(- OCTOPOD = 8 legs) Tj
T*
(- MYRIAPOD = more than 8 legs \(centipede/millipede class\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Main entrypoint:) Tj
T*
(- io.hoyatla.animatruc.forge.preset.AutoGroundContactPresetFactory) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Factory output:) Tj
T*
(- AutoGroundContactPreset) Tj
T*
(  - createIkModifier\(\)) Tj
T*
(  - createGroundController\(\)) Tj
T*
(  - detectionReport\(\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Anti False-Positive Leg Detection Strategy) Tj
T*
(Detection is score-based and rejects weak chains.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3.1 Naming score) Tj
T*
(Positive tokens:) Tj
T*
(- End: foot, paw, hoof, toe, claw) Tj
T*
(- Mid: lower_leg, shin, knee, tibia, calf) Tj
T*
(- Root: upper_leg, thigh, hip) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3.2 Hierarchy constraints) Tj
T*
(A valid chain must resolve:) Tj
T*
(- end bone -> mid parent -> root parent) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3.3 Exclusion filters) Tj
T*
(The chain is rejected when name tokens match:) Tj
T*
(- arm, hand, finger, wing, tail, head, antenna, horn, ear) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3.4 Geometry sanity checks) Tj
T*
(The chain confidence is improved only if:) Tj
T*
(- upper and lower lengths are non-zero) Tj
T*
(- pivots are coherent for lower-body usage) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3.5 Confidence threshold) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
