7 0 obj
<< /Length 2197 >>
stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
14 TL
50 760 Td
(Only chains above minimum confidence are accepted.) Tj
T*
(Default is 0.55 and configurable.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3.6 Safety caps) Tj
T*
(- maxDetectedChains limits total chain count) Tj
T*
(- maxMyriapodChains limits many-leg profiles) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Recommended Bone Naming) Tj
T*
(Use clear names to maximize stable auto-detection:) Tj
T*
(- left_upper_leg, left_lower_leg, left_foot) Tj
T*
(- right_upper_leg, right_lower_leg, right_foot) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Hexapod example:) Tj
T*
(- front_left_upper_leg / front_left_lower_leg / front_left_foot) Tj
T*
(- mid_left_upper_leg   / mid_left_lower_leg   / mid_left_foot) Tj
T*
(- rear_left_upper_leg  / rear_left_lower_leg  / rear_left_foot) Tj
T*
(\(and right side equivalent\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Myriapod recommendation:) Tj
T*
(- segment_00_left_upper_leg ... segment_00_left_foot) Tj
T*
(- segment_00_right_upper_leg ... segment_00_right_foot) Tj
T*
(- repeat by segment index) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Runtime Integration Flow) Tj
T*
(Step 1: Load pack and read skeleton) Tj
T*
(Step 2: Detect preset via AutoGroundContactPresetFactory) Tj
T*
(Step 3: Add IK modifier to animator) Tj
T*
(Step 4: Every client tick, update ground controller and inject targets in AnimatorContext) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Reference snippet:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Optional<AutoGroundContactPreset> preset =) Tj
T*
(AutoGroundContactPresetFactory.detect\(pack.skeleton\(\)\);) Tj
T*
(if \(preset.isPresent\(\)\) {) Tj
T*
(    AutoGroundContactPreset p = preset.get\(\);) Tj
T*
(    animator.addModifier\(p.createIkModifier\(\)\);) Tj
T*
(    GroundContactController controller = p.createGroundController\(\);) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(    Map<String, Vec3f> targets = controller.update\(entity, entity.getYRot\(\), partialTicks\);) Tj
T*
(    AnimatorContext ctx = GroundContactContextAdapter.attachTargets\() Tj
T*
(            AnimatorContext.visibleNear\(\),) Tj
T*
(            targets,) Tj
T*
(            GroundContactContextAdapter.horizontalSpeed\(entity\)) Tj
T*
(    \);) Tj
T*
(    animator.update\(ctx, partialTicks\);) Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Configuration Menu \(Lightweight Machines\)) Tj
T*
(File:) Tj
T*
(- config/animatruc-client.toml) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
