() Tj
T*
(In-game menu:) Tj
T*
(- AnimaTruc Presets) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Toggles:) Tj
T*
(- enableAutoDetection) Tj
T*
(- enableBipedPreset) Tj
T*
(- enableHexapodPreset) Tj
T*
(- enableOctopodPreset) Tj
T*
(- enableMyriapodPreset) Tj
T*
(- enableGroundRaycast) Tj
T*
(- performanceMode = FULL / BALANCED / LIGHT) Tj
T*
(- minDetectionConfidence) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Performance recommendation:) Tj
T*
(- FULL: high quality, higher CPU) Tj
T*
(- BALANCED: default) Tj
T*
(- LIGHT: low-end hardware mode) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Client/Server Side Rules) Tj
T*
(- Ground-contact raycasts and IK target generation should run client-side for visual animation.) Tj
T*
(- Keep gameplay authority on server and do not attach combat/game logic to visual IK output.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. Myriapod Specific Notes) Tj
T*
(- Keep chain cap enabled \(maxMyriapodChains\).) Tj
T*
(- Use shorter step distance and lift height.) Tj
T*
(- Use LIGHT mode on low-end hardware.) Tj
T*
(- Keep naming regular by segment index and side.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(9. Debug Checklist) Tj
T*
(If legs are misdetected:) Tj
T*
(- verify clear leg naming) Tj
T*
(- ensure 3-bone chain hierarchy exists) Tj
T*
(- lower confidence threshold only when naming cannot be changed) Tj
T*
(- inspect detectionReport warnings) Tj
T*
(- disable problematic profile in config menu) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(10. API Locations) Tj
T*
(Core detection:) Tj
T*
(- animatruc-proprietary-core/src/main/java/io/hoyatla/animatruc/core/preset/) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Forge preset/config:) Tj
T*
(- animatruc-forge/src/main/java/io/hoyatla/animatruc/forge/preset/) Tj
T*
(- animatruc-forge/src/main/java/io/hoyatla/animatruc/forge/config/) Tj
T*
(- animatruc-forge/src/main/java/io/hoyatla/animatruc/forge/ground/) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(End of manual.) Tj
ET
